{"sourceUrl":"http://maths.whut.edu.cn/yjsjy/zsxx/202609/t20260917_1418220.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:10.133236+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://maths.whut.edu.cn/yjsjy/zsxx/202609/t20260917_1418220.shtml","html":"<article>\n<div>\n<h3>\n            武汉理工大学数学与统计学院2027年推荐免试攻读硕士学位（和直接攻读博士学位）研究生招生简章\n          </h3>\n<span>发布日期：2026-09-17</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><p><span>    一、申请条件</span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康，诚实守信，学风端正，无考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果或其他违法违纪行为，无受处分（处罚）记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span>获得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格</span></span><span><span><span>,</span></span></span><span><span>并在教育部“推免服务系统”报名成功者。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.2027</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>日前获得本科毕业证书。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span>招</span></span><span><span>收推免</span></span><span><span>生本科</span></span><span><span>毕</span></span><span><span>业专业</span></span><span><span>限</span></span><span><span>制：</span></span></p><p><span><span>数\n 学：数学、统计、计算机等与数学学科相关专业。</span></span></p><p><span><span>应用统计：统计学、数学、计算机、经济学等相关专业。</span></span></p><p><span><span>二、招生类别和招生人数</span></span></p><p><span><span>（一）本科直博生</span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span>序号</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>专业名称</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>专业代码</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>学习形式</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>拟招生人数</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>数学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>070100</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>全日制</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span>注：本科直博生实际招生人数可根据实际情况做适当调整</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）硕士研究生</span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span>序号</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>专业名称</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>专业代码</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>学习形式</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>拟招生人数</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>数学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>070100</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>全日制</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>应用统计</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>025200</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>全日制</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>16</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>应用统计（襄阳示范区）</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>025200</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>全日制</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span>注：硕士研究生实际招生人数可根据实际情况做适当调整</span></span></p><p><span><span>三、申请、复试、录取工作安排</span></span></p><p><span><span>研招网“推免服务系统”预计于</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>21</span></span></span><span><span>日开放，推免生申请、复试与录取工作安排如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>1.</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>推免生报考</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>获得推免生资格的应届本科毕业生阅读学校和学院《接收推免生简章》，符合条件者，登录中国研究生招生信息网（以下简称研招网）的“推免服务系统”（网址：</span></span><span><span><span>http</span></span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span>//yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span></span><span><span>）注册、填报专业志愿，按申请学院《推免生招生简章》的要求提交相关材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>2.</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>复试通知</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>我院招生工作小组审查考生报名材料，报名材料以考生在研招网“推免服务系统”提供的材料为准，不再接收其他电子邮件或纸质材料。学院工作人员通过研招网“推免服务系统”向符合条件的申请考生发出复试通知，并逐一电话通知考生。考生须保持通讯畅通。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>3.</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>考生确认同意复试</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>考生接到复试通知后</span></span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span><span><span>小时内在教育部推免服务系统确认是否同意复试。同意复试的信息以教育部推免服务系统信息为准。若考生收到我院复试通知后</span></span><span><span><span>24</span></span></span><span><span>小时内未在教育部推免服务系统确认同意复试，经电话沟通后，我院可撤销该生复试通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>4.</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>考生参加复试</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>同意参加复试的申请人按约定时间参加复试，由复试专家进行提问和考评。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>5.</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>发送待录取通知</strong></span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://maths.whut.edu.cn/yjsjy/zsxx/202609/t20260917_1418220.shtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>我院汇总复试情况，报学院研究生招生委员会，审核通过且在推免服务系统该环节开启后，通过教育部推免服务系统向考生发出待录取通知，电话通知考生，并上报复试成绩。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>6.</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>确认接收待录取</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>及时在教育部推免服务系统确认接收待录取。在系统该环节开启后，逾</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>小时未确认考生，视为自动放弃待录取资格，经电话沟通后，我院可撤销该生待录取通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>7.</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>公示拟录取名单</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>按期确认待录取的考生，视为同意将我校作为其唯一录取学校，进入拟录取环节。我院汇总同意待录取的考生名单，并进行网上公示。</span></span></p><p><span><span>四、注意事项</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>申请人必须保证全部申请材料的真实性和准确性，一经发现申请人提交的材料内容不真实或不准确，我校将取消拟录取或录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>根据教育部有关接收推免生的时间安排，获得推免资格的学生必须在教育部“推免服务系统”选报学校和专业，未在规定时间完成网上操作，将视为自动放弃推免资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.2027</span></span></span><span><span>年推免生注册、报名、缴费及拟录取全部在教育部“推免服务系统”进行，拟录取考生不再进行报名确认。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span>招生专业及拟招人数在“推免服务系统”中查询。</span></span></p><p><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：梁老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span><span><span>027-87108021</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：武汉理工大学南湖校区数学与统计学院</span></span><span><span><span>209</span></span></span><span><span>办公室</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮编：</span></span><span><span><span>430070</span></span></span></p></div>\n</div>\n</article>","textSha256":"34a710e6dab9790d5f6b483e608bc42715d8eaa8bcab0e7ec6582a805fd315f0","textLength":1457,"sourceSha256":"2ac924e6363293f4e11dc277dcb77f5ecb04fb645cac7dd86a2f6c048435899b","selector":".article_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d3035afb90da7c6729bd","title":"2026年武汉理工大学数学与统计学院2027年推荐免试攻读硕士学位（和直接攻读博士学位）研究生招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:10.133236+00:00"}
